WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.760
THUGS IN BANDANAS THROUGH ROCKS

00:01.760 --> 00:03.580
AND BOTTLES AT ICE AGENTS ON

00:03.580 --> 00:04.680
PATROL.

00:04.680 --> 00:06.040
CHICAGO POLICE?

00:06.040 --> 00:07.680
NOWHERE TO BE FOUND.

00:07.680 --> 00:09.440
ONE WOMAN WITH A RIFLE RAMMED

00:09.440 --> 00:11.240
HER CAR INTO AN ICE VEHICLE USING

00:11.240 --> 00:12.420
IT AS A WEAPON.

00:12.420 --> 00:13.840
THE ICE VEHICLE WAS DISABLED,

00:13.840 --> 00:15.240
LEAVING AGENTS TRAPPED AND

00:15.240 --> 00:17.120
FORCED TO OPEN FIRE.

00:17.120 --> 00:20.080
THE DRIVER, MARIMAR MARTINEZ,

00:20.080 --> 00:21.480
SHE WAS FLAGGED LAST WEEK FOR

00:21.480 --> 00:23.260
DOXING AGENTS AND POSTING THIS,

00:23.260 --> 00:24.960
QUOTE, HEY, TO ALL MY GANG,

00:24.960 --> 00:27.060
LET'S F THESE MOTHER F-ERS UP.

00:27.060 --> 00:29.360
DON'T LET THEM TAKE ANYONE.

00:29.360 --> 00:30.800
THIS WAS THE SECOND RAMMING

00:30.800 --> 00:32.540
INCIDENT OVER THE WEEKEND.

00:32.540 --> 00:33.800
THE FEDS TRIED CALLING FOR

00:33.800 --> 00:36.700
BACKUP BUT CHICAGO PD WAS ORDERED

00:36.700 --> 00:37.660
TO PULL A BENGHAZI.

